{"title":"Ogre Firespeaker","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 51 Ogre that attacks with crush (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/ogre-bone-needle\">Ogre Bone Needle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 5 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 6 recorded drops, 548 total, 41–125 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×41–125</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ogrewax-knick\" title=\"Ogrewax Knick - in 5 of 5 looted corpses, 5 recorded drops, 5 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b734a810757d0d5d1409.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-arms\" title=\"Titanium Arms - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/bb0d8fcc8405579f74ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Flawless: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"thorn-head\" title=\"Thorn Head - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/dd84a2400daf93f8aefd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thorn Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+4 more\">+4 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"scroll-fireball\" title=\"Scroll Fireball - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6b66cd8cfb8dcdd17e1d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Scroll Fireball</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-sword\" title=\"Titanium Sword - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9df6d6b127ab73a6a326.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Sword</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"thorn-feet\" title=\"Thorn Feet - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c545c7eb5d27184e604d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thorn Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"lizper-torso\" title=\"Lizper Torso - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/46936312b236333fa7be.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lizper Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Ogre Longhouse</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 24</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"5403\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/old-mother-ashka\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/c9d4aa1be4f688f3b580.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>Old Mother Ashka</b><span>Lv 51</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Ogre: <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth\">Ogre Youth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(30)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt\">Gaunt Ogre</a> <span class=\"muted\">(33)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre\">Ogre</a> <span class=\"muted\">(35)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler\">Ogre Mauler</a> <span class=\"muted\">(38)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher\">Ogre Butcher</a> <span class=\"muted\">(40)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger\">Ogre Charger</a> <span class=\"muted\">(42)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman\">Ogre Shaman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(44)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder\">Ogre Elder</a> <span class=\"muted\">(46)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain\">Mountain Ogre</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-carver\">Ogre Carver</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-unmoved\">The Unmoved</a> <span class=\"muted\">(52)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-warchief\">Ogre Warchief</a> <span class=\"muted\">(54)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/d0ec02638f2cca1a48be.svg\" alt=\"Ogre Firespeaker\"></div><h3>Ogre Firespeaker</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>51</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 51)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Ogre</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · ranged</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>316</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>32.6</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,550</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.2 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>5</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>5 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}